{
  "id": "u38",
  "section": 5,
  "order": 6,
  "title": "Arguments & patching up",
  "teTitle": "గొడవలు, రాజీలు",
  "cefr": "B1",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Disagree kindly, say sorry like you mean it, and patch things up over coffee.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u38-i01",
      "te": "మీరు నా మాట వినట్లేదు.",
      "gloss": "You're not listening to me.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" },
        { "te": "నా", "gloss": "my" },
        { "te": "మాట", "gloss": "word" },
        { "te": "వినట్లేదు", "gloss": "are not listening" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "వినట్లేదు is spoken shorthand for వినడం లేదు. The -ట్లేదు squeeze works everywhere: చేయట్లేదు, రావట్లేదు.",
      "distractors": ["u38-i03", "u38-i09"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i02",
      "te": "అలా కాదు, నా ఉద్దేశం వేరే.",
      "gloss": "Not like that — I meant something else.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అలా", "gloss": "like that" },
        { "te": "కాదు", "gloss": "it is not" },
        { "te": "నా", "gloss": "my" },
        { "te": "ఉద్దేశం", "gloss": "intention" },
        { "te": "వేరే", "gloss": "different" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments", "disagreeing"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "అలా కాదు is the gentle way in — it disagrees with the words, not the person.",
      "distractors": ["u38-i14", "u38-i01"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i03",
      "te": "నన్ను కూడా మాట్లాడనివ్వండి.",
      "gloss": "Let me speak too.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నన్ను", "gloss": "me" },
        { "te": "కూడా", "gloss": "also" },
        { "te": "మాట్లాడనివ్వండి", "gloss": "allow to speak (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u38-i01", "u38-i09"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i04",
      "te": "సారీ, నాదే తప్పు.",
      "gloss": "Sorry, the fault is mine.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "సారీ", "gloss": "sorry" },
        { "te": "నాదే", "gloss": "mine indeed" },
        { "te": "తప్పు", "gloss": "fault" }
      ],
      "tags": ["apology"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "నాదే — 'mine and no one else's' — that little -ఏ makes the apology land as fully owned.",
      "distractors": ["u38-i05", "u38-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i05",
      "te": "నేను అలా అనాల్సింది కాదు.",
      "gloss": "I shouldn't have said that.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నేను", "gloss": "I" },
        { "te": "అలా", "gloss": "like that" },
        { "te": "అనాల్సింది", "gloss": "should have said" },
        { "te": "కాదు", "gloss": "not" }
      ],
      "tags": ["apology"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u38-i04", "u38-i11"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i06",
      "te": "వదిలేయండి, పెద్ద విషయం కాదు.",
      "gloss": "Let it go, it's not a big deal.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "వదిలేయండి", "gloss": "let it go (polite)" },
        { "te": "పెద్ద", "gloss": "big" },
        { "te": "విషయం", "gloss": "matter" },
        { "te": "కాదు", "gloss": "is not" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u38-i07", "u38-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i07",
      "te": "మనసులో పెట్టుకోకండి.",
      "gloss": "Don't hold it in your heart.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మనసులో", "gloss": "in the heart" },
        { "te": "పెట్టుకోకండి", "gloss": "don't keep (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "Grudges in Telugu are 'kept in the మనసు'. This line asks someone not to file the hurt away.",
      "distractors": ["u38-i06", "u38-i08"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i08",
      "te": "మీ మీద కోపం లేదు.",
      "gloss": "I'm not angry with you.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "you (polite)" },
        { "te": "మీద", "gloss": "on / towards" },
        { "te": "కోపం", "gloss": "anger" },
        { "te": "లేదు", "gloss": "there is not" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "Anger sits ON people in Telugu: మీ మీద కోపం — 'anger on you'. కోపం వచ్చింది = anger came; it arrives and leaves on its own."
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i09",
      "te": "ఒక్క నిమిషం నా మాట వినండి.",
      "gloss": "Listen to me for just one minute.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఒక్క", "gloss": "just one" },
        { "te": "నిమిషం", "gloss": "minute" },
        { "te": "నా", "gloss": "my" },
        { "te": "మాట", "gloss": "word" },
        { "te": "వినండి", "gloss": "listen (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments"],
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i10",
      "te": "మనం ఇలా గొడవ పడొద్దు.",
      "gloss": "Let's not fight like this.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మనం", "gloss": "we (you and I)" },
        { "te": "ఇలా", "gloss": "like this" },
        { "te": "గొడవ", "gloss": "quarrel" },
        { "te": "పడొద్దు", "gloss": "shouldn't fall into" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u38-i12", "u38-i13"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i11",
      "te": "నాకు కొంచెం కోపం వచ్చింది, నిజమే.",
      "gloss": "I did get a little angry, it's true.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "కోపం", "gloss": "anger" },
        { "te": "వచ్చింది", "gloss": "came" },
        { "te": "నిజమే", "gloss": "it's true" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments", "apology"],
      "difficulty": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i12",
      "te": "సరే, మర్చిపోదాం.",
      "gloss": "Okay, let's forget it.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "సరే", "gloss": "okay" },
        { "te": "మర్చిపోదాం", "gloss": "let's forget" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u38-i10", "u38-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i13",
      "te": "మనం మళ్ళీ ఫ్రెండ్సే కదా?",
      "gloss": "We're friends again, right?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మనం", "gloss": "we" },
        { "te": "మళ్ళీ", "gloss": "again" },
        { "te": "ఫ్రెండ్సే", "gloss": "friends indeed" },
        { "te": "కదా", "gloss": "right?" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u38-i12", "u38-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i14",
      "te": "మీరు అన్నది కూడా నిజమే.",
      "gloss": "What you said is also true.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" },
        { "te": "అన్నది", "gloss": "what was said" },
        { "te": "కూడా", "gloss": "also" },
        { "te": "నిజమే", "gloss": "is true indeed" }
      ],
      "tags": ["arguments", "disagreeing"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "The peacemaker's move: concede a point before making yours. కూడా నిజమే — 'that's also true' — softens everything after it."
    },
    {
      "id": "u38-i15",
      "te": "రండి, కాఫీ తాగుదాం.",
      "gloss": "Come, let's have coffee.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" },
        { "te": "కాఫీ", "gloss": "coffee" },
        { "te": "తాగుదాం", "gloss": "let's drink" }
      ],
      "tags": ["making-peace"],
      "difficulty": 2
    }
  ],
